    "Postulate 2", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "8ff009ef-f2e8-4477-a423-be893896c3cc"], Cell["\<\
To produce a finite straight line continuously in a straight line.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"91d03ca0-f2b5-4d2e-ad1e-8e07a1bfd03a"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "425a77f6-a9fc-48b7-87ab-2eaf20de184b"], Cell[
    "Euclid", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "818e6df9-df21-4957-8274-8a309545f27e"], Cell[
    "Postulate 5", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "dd5f27f1-088d-4fba-8daf-5b78ec50094d"], Cell[
    "The parallel postulate quantifies over lines.", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"616dba5b-29e0-437c-95d1-36605602ae4c"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "90f0b627-e63b-4ddc-a466-7e861bbba233"], Cell[
    "Hilbert", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "b52e068d-64dc-47ec-8cfa-7e10f39cf6ee"], Cell[
    "I.1, I.2", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "35bec435-e964-42da-87ef-554ccb54cc92"], Cell["\<\
Two points determine one and only one line. Here they determine a family.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"70af3024-3624-419f-a4df-8e6788cffcc4"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "ff90e1ca-9bfe-4b9f-a607-29a601d99bb5"], Cell[
