    "(derived)", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "e0cbb7f0-8059-426e-93d7-078ea4e399b3"], Cell["\<\
Lines are not primitive; collinearity is defined from betweenness.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"2893c6c8-87cd-4c38-8f84-e34f3681a68b"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
